  "post_title": "Vuelca un camión cisterna en una rotonda de Onda y el conductor sale ileso",
  "post_date": "2017-03-06 14:36:54",
  "post_name": "vuelca-un-camion-cisterna-en-una-rotonda-de-onda-y-el-conductor-sale-ileso",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Noticias|Sucesos",
  "post_content": "<p>(24 fotos) Un cami&oacute;n cisterna ha volcado hacia las 12 horas de este lunes en la rotonda de entrada a Onda por la carretera CV-20, donde est&aacute;n Euromaster-Neum&aacute;ticos Andr&eacute;s y Natucer, para cuya f&aacute;brica era el producto blanco &#39;pulvuruliento&#39;, seg&uacute;n la Guardia Civil, que transportaba. El conductor ha salido ileso y s&oacute;lo se ha esparcido un poco por la calzada, adem&aacute;s del gas-oil del dep&oacute;sito del cami&oacute;n.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/03/P1510383.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Operarios de PAVASAL, empresa concesionaria del mantenimiento de carreteras han ido limpiando, mientras los bomberos revisaban el cami&oacute;n, la Polic&iacute;a Local desviaba el tr&aacute;fico de entrada a Onda por la avenida Asturias y el pol&iacute;gono industrial del Colador, y la Guardia Civil tomaba declaraci&oacute;n al conductor para realizar el atestado. Se trata de un joven nacido en 1991, A.G.M., que no ha necesitado atenci&oacute;n por parte de los servicios sanitarios de la ambulancia de Soporte Vital B&aacute;sico (SVB) que ha llegado al principio.</p>\n<p>Hasta media tarde, la gr&uacute;a no retirar&aacute; el cami&oacute;n cisterna y se restablecer&aacute; el tr&aacute;fico de entrada a Onda, que ha sido en todo momento normal de salida hacia Vila-real.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510367.jpg\" alt=\"p1510367\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510368.jpg\" alt=\"p1510368\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510370.jpg\" alt=\"p1510370\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510371.jpg\" alt=\"p1510371\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510372.jpg\" alt=\"p1510372\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510373.jpg\" alt=\"p1510373\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510374.jpg\" alt=\"p1510374\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510375.jpg\" alt=\"p1510375\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510376.jpg\" alt=\"p1510376\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510377.jpg\" alt=\"p1510377\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510379.jpg\" alt=\"p1510379\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510380.jpg\" alt=\"p1510380\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510381.jpg\" alt=\"p1510381\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510382.jpg\" alt=\"p1510382\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510383.jpg\" alt=\"p1510383\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510384.jpg\" alt=\"p1510384\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510385.jpg\" alt=\"p1510385\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510386.jpg\" alt=\"p1510386\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510387.jpg\" alt=\"p1510387\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510388.jpg\" alt=\"p1510388\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510389.jpg\" alt=\"p1510389\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510390.jpg\" alt=\"p1510390\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510391.jpg\" alt=\"p1510391\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiocisternavolcatglorietanatucer/p1510392.jpg\" alt=\"p1510392\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
